From: Harshit Gupta <39994376+arelyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:00:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/drm: purge the BO cache and retry when a BO
 allocation fails

Xenos has a 48 MB GPU pool. When the kernel refuses a buffer, give back
the buffers cached for reuse and try once more at the requested size
rather than the bucket-rounded one (a 21 MB texture asked for 24 MB).
piglit tex3d-maxsize allocates, deletes and reallocates its largest
texture, and failed on the cached copy.

